    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. can u give me some more detail on how i should document the first step? like, what should i actually say during that verbal warning so it's useful if i eventually have to move to step 2?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "During the first step verbal warning, aim to:\n\n* Specifically state the performance issues, providing examples and dates when they occurred\n* Explain how these issues impact the job, the team, or the organization\n* Discuss expected actions and standards for improvement\n* Offer support and resources for addressing the issues\n* Reiterate that this warning is a one-time opportunity to correct the performance issues\n\nExample script: \"John, I wanted to speak with you about your recent performance. You've been struggling with meeting deadlines and not meeting expectations. Can you tell me what you think is causing these issues and how we can work together to improve?\"",
